<Base title="Why ReelsZen — One iPhone, one belief | Hyderabad" description="Started with one iPhone and a belief: memories shouldn't take two months. On-site editors, same-night delivery.">
<section class="bg-ivory text-char pt-[120px] pb-24 min-h-screen"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 grid gap-9 lg:grid-cols-2 items-center">
  <div>
    <span class="text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[3px] uppercase text-[#9a7a2e]">— Why ReelsZen</span>
    <h1 class="font-serif-d mt-3" style="font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,56px)">Started with one iPhone. And one belief.</h1>
    <p class="text-char/70 mt-4">Your memories should not take two months. We shoot across Hyderabad, edit on-site at your venue, deliver before the celebration ends.</p>
    <div class="bg-white border border-char/10 rounded-2xl p-6 mt-5"><h4 class="font-serif-d text-lg mb-2">“But we already have a videographer?”</h4><p class="text-sm text-char/70">Keep them. They craft the long film for decades. <b>ReelsZen is the missing piece</b> — the vertical cinematic cut for sharing <i>tonight</i>, while the family is still together.</p></div>
    <div class="bg-sagesoft rounded-2xl p-6 mt-4"><h4 class="font-serif-d text-lg mb-2">🛡️ Our promise</h4><p class="text-sm text-char/70">One price everywhere. Real work only. Dates confirmed personally on WhatsApp. No double-booking, ever.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
